&lt;p&gt;Well that was easy. We were lazy of course and didn't do any actual memory management. Maybe later.&lt;br&gt;
This is still pretty safe and difficult to break. We should however handle copying and assignment as users of Buffer are bound to want to do such things.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

